    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: Those guys to my left just sit at the front of the room and argue about
        recycling.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'They''re missing the cream of the crop: composting'
    - Name: 
      Entry: 13
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
